{07 15 00}I think it's idiotic to
expect to strike it rich by{01 00 00 05 00}
fossil hunting, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}But even I might fall for{01 00 00 0a 00}
the kind of guy who'd cling
to such a crazy dream.

{07 14 00}Getting down in the dirt
once in a while is
actually kind of nice.{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 1b 00}The key phrase here is
"once in a while," {01 00 00 05 00}
{04 02 00}!
